AIDetx2 Dataset — Licensing Notice

This repository does not use a single license for all of its contents.
The human-written and AI-generated text samples originate from multiple
external sources and language models, each subject to its own license
and/or copyright terms. No blanket license (e.g. CC BY 4.0) applies to
the dataset as a whole.

See the "Licensing and Data Usage" section of README.md for the full
breakdown of source and model licenses.

Summary:
  - Human-written samples: rights and license retained by original
    source (BBC News dataset, News dataset, arXiv, Open Library).
  - AI-generated samples: subject to the license of the model that
    generated them (Llama 3.1 Community License, Apache 2.0, or MIT
    — see README.md for the per-model table).
  - Dataset organization, document IDs, and metadata created by the
    authors of this repository are released under CC BY 4.0
    (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Users are responsible for verifying that their intended use of any
individual sample complies with the applicable source or model license.
